# From the lower wire level to the upper one: west at y = 1, east at y = 3, the
# dust climbing a block at a time on stone steps, the way the crossing's north-
# south arm climbs (a signal steps up onto dust whose block below it does not
# block, and steps down onto a block that conducts). Turned, it joins any edge's
# lower port to the opposite edge's upper one; a signal runs either way. The
# whole tile is one net's, so it has no room for a second one or a repeater.
tile ramp
size 5 4 5
port W io 0 1 2
port E io 4 3 2

legend
  G minecraft:glass
  # minecraft:stone
  - minecraft:redstone_wire

layer 0
  .....
  .....
  GG...
  .....
  .....
layer 1
  .....
  .....
  --#..
  .....
  .....
layer 2
  .....
  .....
  ..-##
  .....
  .....
layer 3
  .....
  .....
  ...--
  .....
  .....
